OL,3,AUK raises case of British activist
OL,4,Adetained by settlers in West Bank with
OL,5,AIsrael
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK Foreign Office says it has
OL,8,Fraised the detention of a British
OL,9,Fnational in the occupied West Bank with
OL,10,FIsraeli authorities.
OL,12,FFinn Joughin, a 22-year-old student
OL,13,Factivist, was arrested in Umm Al-Kheir
OL,14,Fon Saturday after he was forcibly
OL,15,Fdetained by Israeli settlers who had
OL,16,Fadvanced on the Palestinian village.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
