OL,3,AUK raises case of British activist
OL,4,Adetained by settlers in West Bank with
OL,5,AIsrael
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere has been a surge in attacks by
OL,8,Fsettlers on Palestinians and their
OL,9,Fproperty in the West Bank since the
OL,10,Fstart of the Gaza war, which was
OL,11,Ftriggered by the Hamas-led attack on
OL,12,FIsrael on 7 October 2023.
OL,14,FAll settlements are illegal under
OL,15,Finternational law. Outposts are also
OL,16,Fillegal under Israeli law, although
OL,17,Fthey are often supported by state
OL,18,Fservices and funding.
